# Git Bash runs win/tandem and the bin scripts by their #! line; a CRLF there, as a Windows checkout with
# autocrlf would write it, breaks them. cmd wants CRLF in its own files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
# The installers fetch an archive of this repository; the demo video would be most of it.
assets/ export-ignore
